// AREA isles: once the vanes face the wind (lore/isles/islands.lute, the
// windmill puzzle), the loft opens and the Dusk grunt holding the Mistral lens
// is up there.

## The loft

::bg{location="mistral-windmill" time="day"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The loft hatch swings open on the turning of the sails. Up among the gears, a grunt clutches the Mistral lens.
::use{component="trainerBattle" who="duskGruntGale" intro="You turned the sails? I was hiding up here!" win="The wind's on your side, fine." lose="Blown away!" prize="1800" instance="use-001"}
::assert{islesLensBack(mistral) when="@wonFight"}
